WEBVTT

00:00:14.477 --> 00:00:15.811
(GRUNTS)

00:00:15.895 --> 00:00:17.897
(PANTING AND GRUNTING)

00:00:26.864 --> 00:00:28.157
Alberto?

00:00:36.833 --> 00:00:38.459
What are you doing here?

00:00:39.168 --> 00:00:40.211
I'm...

00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:42.171
I'm sorry.

00:00:43.506 --> 00:00:45.883
I... I never should've done that.

00:00:45.967 --> 00:00:47.093
I wish I could take it back.

00:00:47.176 --> 00:00:50.263
Yeah, whatever. You're sorry.
Now, just go away!

00:00:50.346 --> 00:00:51.472
(SIGHS)

00:01:08.948 --> 00:01:09.949
LUCA: Alberto?

00:01:10.575 --> 00:01:12.618
What are those marks on the wall?

00:01:14.287 --> 00:01:15.997
Tell me what they mean.

00:01:16.706 --> 00:01:17.748
(ALBERTO SIGHS)

00:01:19.125 --> 00:01:20.918
I started when my dad left.

00:01:22.378 --> 00:01:26.215
You were living here alone
for that many days?

00:01:26.924 --> 00:01:28.009
(ALBERTO SNIFFLES)

00:01:28.092 --> 00:01:30.386
I just stopped counting after a while.

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:33.264
He said I was old enough to be on my own.

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:37.727
I just thought that...

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:39.228
(SIGHS)

00:01:39.312 --> 00:01:40.730
...maybe he'd change his mind.

00:01:42.523 --> 00:01:44.025
Honestly, though, I get it.

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:45.860
He's better off without me.

00:01:46.694 --> 00:01:47.695
You are, too.

00:01:47.778 --> 00:01:48.905
That's not true.

00:01:48.988 --> 00:01:50.072
ALBERTO: Yes, it is.

00:01:50.156 --> 00:01:52.408
You're not like me. You're the good kid.

00:01:52.909 --> 00:01:55.369
(TEARFULLY) And I'm just
the kid that ruins everything.

00:01:55.745 --> 00:01:59.499
Silenzio, Bruno. That's just
the dumb voice in your head.

00:01:59.582 --> 00:02:00.750
You taught me that.

00:02:00.833 --> 00:02:03.002
And getting a Vespa? Seeing the world...

00:02:03.085 --> 00:02:04.670
Just let it go! Okay?

00:02:04.754 --> 00:02:06.547
Look, you and I
should've never been friends

00:02:06.631 --> 00:02:07.632
in the first place.

00:02:08.424 --> 00:02:09.759
LUCA: Don't say that.

00:02:09.842 --> 00:02:11.427
-Alberto?
-Get outta here!

00:02:11.511 --> 00:02:13.429
I'm not gonna tell you again.

00:02:18.768 --> 00:02:20.603
Okay. I'll go.

00:02:21.354 --> 00:02:22.522
I'll go win the race.

00:02:23.189 --> 00:02:24.607
-What?
-LUCA: Yeah.

00:02:25.066 --> 00:02:28.027
Yeah! And then the Vespa will be ours!

00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:29.904
And we'll ride away together!

00:02:29.987 --> 00:02:31.781
Luca, that's crazy.

00:02:31.864 --> 00:02:33.032
Well, maybe I'm crazy.

00:02:33.115 --> 00:02:34.742
Take me, gravity!

00:02:34.825 --> 00:02:35.910
ALBERTO: Luca!

00:02:35.993 --> 00:02:37.995
(GRUNTS) Ow.

00:02:38.329 --> 00:02:39.622
What are you doing?

00:02:39.705 --> 00:02:42.124
I'm okay. I'll be back tomorrow.

00:02:42.208 --> 00:02:44.126
I'm gonna fix this!

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:48.339
-(INDISTINCT CHATTERING)
-(BRASS BAND MUSIC PLAYING)

00:02:49.715 --> 00:02:51.759
You want to split up your team?

00:02:51.843 --> 00:02:53.427
Yes. If it's allowed.

00:02:53.511 --> 00:02:55.304
Luca? What are you doing here?

00:02:55.388 --> 00:02:57.181
Don't worry. I'll race on my own.

00:02:57.265 --> 00:02:59.642
You can if you want,
but I don't recommend it.

00:02:59.725 --> 00:03:00.810
LUCA: Thank you!

00:03:00.893 --> 00:03:02.270
But how are you gonna...

00:03:02.353 --> 00:03:04.689
I mean, what happens when the...

00:03:04.772 --> 00:03:06.399
You can't swim!

00:03:06.482 --> 00:03:07.900
Alone again?

00:03:07.984 --> 00:03:09.068
(GRUNTS)

00:03:10.611 --> 00:03:11.612
DANIELA: Hmm.

00:03:11.696 --> 00:03:12.697
-Ah, volunteers...
-Huh?

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:13.781
-...you're late.
-Huh?

00:03:13.865 --> 00:03:14.866
One cup for each kid.

00:03:14.949 --> 00:03:15.950
Oh!

00:03:16.033 --> 00:03:17.285
-Yeah. One cup per kid.
-LORENZO: Yes.

00:03:17.368 --> 00:03:18.369
-Got it.
-Here.

00:03:18.452 --> 00:03:21.038
For when Giulia, you know, she... (GAGS)

00:03:21.122 --> 00:03:22.790
(CROWD CHEERING)

00:03:26.919 --> 00:03:28.629
(CHEERS IN ITALIAN)

00:03:30.756 --> 00:03:32.091
(GIULIA SIGHS, GRUNTS)

00:03:32.175 --> 00:03:34.886
Ciccio, hold still. Olio d'oliva.

00:03:34.969 --> 00:03:37.013
He will cut through the water
like a knife.

00:03:37.096 --> 00:03:39.182
-Oh! Ah.
-An oily knife.

00:03:39.891 --> 00:03:40.892
Huh?

00:03:40.975 --> 00:03:42.518
KIDS: Huh?

00:03:44.687 --> 00:03:46.147
(CROWD MURMURING)

00:03:48.316 --> 00:03:50.234
(CHUCKLES) This makes me laugh.

00:03:50.318 --> 00:03:51.402
(LAUGHING)

00:03:51.485 --> 00:03:53.571
I guess even your terrible friends

00:03:53.654 --> 00:03:54.739
don't want to be friends.

00:03:54.822 --> 00:03:57.658
Luca! This is a very bad idea!

00:03:57.742 --> 00:03:59.243
Hey, vagrant!

00:03:59.327 --> 00:04:01.662
Can't afford a proper swimsuit?

00:04:01.746 --> 00:04:03.122
Signore e signori,

00:04:03.206 --> 00:04:06.167
the Portorosso Cup is about to begin!

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:08.711
We know there's been
a few sightings lately,

00:04:08.794 --> 00:04:10.129
but fear not!

00:04:10.213 --> 00:04:12.173
If any sea monsters show up today,

00:04:12.256 --> 00:04:13.758
we are ready for them.

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:15.301
(GASPS)

00:04:16.344 --> 00:04:18.679
MARSIGLIESE: Swimmers, take your mark!

00:04:18.763 --> 00:04:19.805
(BREATHING HEAVILY)

00:04:22.433 --> 00:04:24.477
(LUCA BREATHING NERVOUSLY)

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:26.562
-(BELL CLANGING)
-(CROWD CHEERING)

00:04:30.316 --> 00:04:31.400
(EXHALES SHARPLY)

00:04:36.531 --> 00:04:38.533
(SWIMMERS GRUNTING AND BREATHING HEAVILY)

00:04:39.909 --> 00:04:41.911
(UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING)

00:04:44.247 --> 00:04:45.414
(YELPS)

00:04:48.876 --> 00:04:50.002
(WHIMPERS)

00:04:52.463 --> 00:04:53.881
(LUCA GRUNTING)

00:04:55.174 --> 00:04:56.175
(GLASS CRACKS)

00:04:56.259 --> 00:04:57.301
(GROANS)

00:04:58.052 --> 00:04:59.720
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:04:59.804 --> 00:05:01.138
(WHIMPERING)

00:05:02.056 --> 00:05:03.057
What?

00:05:03.808 --> 00:05:05.184
(GRUNTING)

00:05:10.731 --> 00:05:12.233
Swim, Ciccio! Come on!

00:05:12.316 --> 00:05:14.110
-Swim!
-(CICCIO WHIMPERING)

00:05:14.193 --> 00:05:15.570
(CROWD CHEERING)

00:05:18.739 --> 00:05:20.366
Ha-ha! Trenette!

00:05:25.788 --> 00:05:27.290
(GRUNTS, GASPS)

00:05:31.586 --> 00:05:33.254
-(LUCA GRUNTING)
-(TABLE RATTLING)

00:05:36.632 --> 00:05:37.967
(LUCA PANTING)

00:05:39.385 --> 00:05:40.636
Come on!

00:05:43.598 --> 00:05:45.641
-Thank you.
-Don't thank me.

00:05:45.725 --> 00:05:46.726
(WHIMPERING)

00:05:46.809 --> 00:05:49.437
Stop crying and tag Guido! Imbecille!

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:51.230
Andiamo! Run, run!

00:05:55.401 --> 00:05:56.402
Finito!

00:05:57.153 --> 00:05:58.362
(GROANS)

00:05:58.696 --> 00:06:00.031
(CROWD CHEERING)

00:06:01.949 --> 00:06:04.452
Per mille cavoli, Guido! Faster!

00:06:04.619 --> 00:06:06.412
-Eat, idiota! Più veloce!
-(MUFFLED GRUNTING)

00:06:06.495 --> 00:06:07.788
Hey, that's not allowed.

00:06:07.872 --> 00:06:09.040
He's done!

00:06:09.123 --> 00:06:10.124
(GROANS)

00:06:11.876 --> 00:06:12.877
(GRUNTS)

00:06:13.503 --> 00:06:14.712
Done!

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:16.964
(GROANING)

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:19.050
(PANTING)

00:06:19.634 --> 00:06:20.760
(GRUNTS)

00:06:20.843 --> 00:06:22.178
(BURPS LOUDLY)

00:06:22.261 --> 00:06:23.262
Whoa.

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:26.182
(CROWD CHEERING)

00:06:30.061 --> 00:06:31.896
(THUNDER RUMBLING)

00:06:31.979 --> 00:06:33.689
But he's gotta be here somewhere.

00:06:33.773 --> 00:06:35.358
Thirsty? Water, anyone?

00:06:35.441 --> 00:06:36.609
-Please, don't!
-KID: Not again!

00:06:36.692 --> 00:06:38.444
(GASPS) That's him. That's him!

00:06:38.528 --> 00:06:39.529
-Luca, stop!
-(GASPS)

00:06:39.612 --> 00:06:41.072
(WHIMPERS)

00:06:41.155 --> 00:06:43.741
Sorry, Mom! Sorry, Dad! I have to do this!

00:06:43.824 --> 00:06:46.827
(PANTING) Get back here right now!

00:06:47.286 --> 00:06:49.288
Wow. He's fast.

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:52.416
-(LUCA GRUNTING)
-GIRL: What?

00:06:54.544 --> 00:06:56.379
(PANTING AND GRUNTING)

00:06:59.173 --> 00:07:00.633
-Oops! Scusa.
-(GROWLS)

00:07:00.716 --> 00:07:02.802
I'll catch you on the... (GAGS) downhill!

00:07:02.885 --> 00:07:05.638
Spewlia, you never even
made it to the downhill.

00:07:05.721 --> 00:07:06.722
(LAUGHING)

00:07:06.806 --> 00:07:08.516
What? (PANTING)

00:07:10.852 --> 00:07:14.897
Impossibile! He's cheating!
Arbitro! Arbitro!

00:07:15.898 --> 00:07:17.191
-(RAINDROPS FALLING)
-Huh?

00:07:17.275 --> 00:07:18.317
No, no, no!

00:07:22.029 --> 00:07:23.030
(DANIELA GASPS)

00:07:23.739 --> 00:07:24.740
LORENZO: Ooh.

